1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:09,500
Meet Zoree Smart TMS — the AI-powered platform that helps you plan, optimize, execute, and track every shipment.

2
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:19,500
Let's follow one shipment from order to delivery — and watch Zoree Smart TMS handle every step.

3
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:25,250
Everything your team needs — planning, rating, and execution — under one roof.

4
00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:31,750
Start in Orders. Pick an order, hit Plan, and Zoree shops every carrier for you.

5
00:00:31,750 --> 00:00:41,500
Live rates, side by side. LTL pricing comes straight from CzarLite — grab the cheapest, or pick whoever you trust.

6
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:48,000
Headed the same way on the same days? Zoree quietly combines them into one truck.

7
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Two orders, one truckload, ready to roll.

8
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Here's the whole load at a glance — then tender it to the carrier in a single click.

9
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:06,500
Tender sent — the load's on its way to the carrier.

10
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:15,250
Their tender lands instantly by email or EDI, with pickup, delivery, dock, and item details.

11
00:01:15,250 --> 00:01:20,750
Carriers say yes or no right inside their own portal.

12
00:01:20,750 --> 00:01:27,250
When they accept, they confirm capacity and drop in details like the PRO number.

13
00:01:27,250 --> 00:01:33,000
And your TMS instantly flips it to Tender Accepted.

14
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:38,500
Once it ships in your OMS, the status rolls over to In Transit.

15
00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:44,500
Every milestone is captured along the way — automatically, or added by hand.

16
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:51,750
The moment it's delivered, that update flows back to your OMS, ready to invoice.

17
00:01:51,750 --> 00:01:57,500
Delivered, wrapped up, and ready to bill — no loose ends.

18
00:01:57,500 --> 00:02:03,500
Or skip the clicks — just ask Zoree AI to plan and tender for you.
